flowchart TD
    %% Administrator Governance & Operations Workflow
    AdminLogin([Admin Logs In via Authenticated Portal]) --> MasterDash[Admin Central Dashboard]

    subgraph UserAndVendor["1. User & Vendor Governance"]
        MasterDash --> UsersList[User Management Table]
        UsersList --> RoleChange[Promote / Demote User Role]
        UsersList --> SuspendUser[Suspend / Reactivate User Account]
        MasterDash --> VendorQueue[Vendor Onboarding Review Queue]
        VendorQueue --> VerifyKYC[Inspect Bank Details & Verify GSTIN]
        VendorQueue --> IssueWarning[Issue Official Compliance Warning]
    end

    subgraph CatalogControl["2. Marketplace Catalog Control"]
        MasterDash --> Categories[Manage Category Taxonomy Tree]
        MasterDash --> Brands[Register & Verify Official Brands]
        MasterDash --> Banners[Upload & Schedule Homepage Hero Banners]
        MasterDash --> Moderation[Inventory Moderation Queue]
        Moderation --> ForceHide[Force Hide Violation Listings with Reason]
        MasterDash --> Coupons[Create Promotional Campaign Coupons via Zod]
    end

    subgraph LogisticsAndDelivery["3. Logistics & Hyperlocal Operations"]
        MasterDash --> AgentsList[Delivery Agent Management]
        AgentsList --> VerifyLicense[Inspect Driving License & Verify Rider]
        MasterDash --> LiveTracking[Monitor Active Hyperlocal Dispatches]
    end

    subgraph FinancialAuditing["4. Financial Reporting & System Config"]
        MasterDash --> SalesReports[Platform GMV & Net Margin Metrics]
        MasterDash --> Settlements[Audit Vendor Commission Settlements]
        MasterDash --> AuditLogs[Inspect Tamper-Evident System Audit Trail]
        MasterDash --> SysSettings[Global Settings: Tax Rates, Fees, Maintenance Mode]
    end
